    "rules": [
      "RECOVERY != RETRY",
      "RETRY EXECUTION != RESUME WORKFLOW",
      "if the canonical writer already wrote business truth, never re-fire it speculatively",
      "before any retry/resume check: latest checkpoint + business_refs + current business truth + previous outcome + acceptance/evidence + approval state + cost already consumed + attempt count",
      "canonical writers must not know any recovery/control runtime",
      "routes must contain no retry logic",
      "no rollback/delete/reset of business truth to pretend a job never happened",
      "destructive actions are never auto-retried",
      "retry is bounded (max_attempts + backoff + terminal state)",
      "a retry that uses a paid resource must pass checkCostGate again and counts as a NEW attempt with new usage evidence"
    ]
